{-
   The half of the suite that only exists on one target - see `Base.yana`.

   `Atomic`, `File`, `Process`, `Environment` and `Native.Thread` are `.native.yana` modules: on a
   JavaScript build the selector leaves them with no files and the module does not exist, which is
   Analysis-Modules.md §5.4's rule seen from the consuming side. Their test files carry the same
   selector for the same reason, so this file and they appear and disappear together.
-}
import Native.Thread
import Atomic
import File
import Process
import Environment
